{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんにちは！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "乃木坂46 6期生の\n瀬戸口心月（せとぐち みつき）です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "シャンシャンシャン、、、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "シャンシャンシャンシャン、、、、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "どこからか、鈴の音が聞こえてきますよ！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日はクリスマスだもん🎄❤️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "皆さんメリークリスマスです！！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "街の空気も、音も、だいすきーー"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "でもね、毎年12月25日を迎えてしまうと、\n終わっちゃうのが悲しくなっちゃうんです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今、バッグにサンタさんのキーホルダーを付けているんですけど、これも今日までか！って思うと、なんだか寂しい！！！！🎅🏼"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "クリスマスが終わると、\n一気に年末モードに入るじゃないですか、、。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "年末モードも好きなんですけど！\nクリスマスも名残惜しくて、急に焦っちゃいます！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "とはいえ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "瀬戸口家は、なかなかツリーが片付けられないタイプでして！！！笑"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "もう年明けちゃったね！とか言いながら、しばらくそのままだったりします🎄"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "皆さんは毎年、\nどんなクリスマスを過ごしていますか？！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ぜひ教えてくださいーー♡"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そしてそして、これは"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この前のオンラインミート＆グリートのときの！"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202512/mobTTFdGD.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "先取りクリスマスしました✨"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "可愛いニットを買いに行ったんです^_^♡\nたくさん褒めてくださりありがとうございました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "少しでも、みなさんと同じクリスマスの空気を感じられていたら嬉しいなーー。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202512/mobGf9N78.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして、先日放送された「乃木坂スター誕生！SIX」\nクリスマス回でした✨🎅🏼"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202512/mobBZeoZz.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私は、愛宕心響ちゃん・鈴木佑捺ちゃんと\n羊文学さんの「1999」を。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "海邉朱莉ちゃん・川端晃菜ちゃん・矢田萌華ちゃんは、桑田佳祐さん&松任谷由実さんの「Kissin’ Christmas (クリスマスだからじゃない）」。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "長嶋凛桜ちゃん・増田三莉音ちゃん・森平麗心ちゃんは、JUDY AND MARYさんの「クリスマス」。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "それぞれ違う色のクリスマスがあって、歌っていても、聴いていても、すごく幸せな時間になりました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "皆んなサンタさんの姿になっていたりして、\nクリスマスをたっぷり感じられて、とても楽しかったです✨✨"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202512/mobaLSBFp.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ぜひ、私たちと一緒にクリスマス過ごしてください❤️"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202512/mobVh8Ddv.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今年のクリスマス、\n何か心に残る時間はありましたか？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "その中に、ほんの少しでも私がいられたら幸せだな。なーんて思いつつ😌"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "皆さん！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "素敵な夜をお過ごしください🌙"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "心月（みつき）"}], "source": "official"}